    "final_answer": "I don't have access to a calendar or schedule system that would contain information about \"night keeper tasks.\" The tools available to me are for creating and managing automated tasks, but not for viewing existing schedules or calendars.\n\nTo find out who has the night keeper task for March, you would need to:\n- Check your calendar application\n- Look at a shared spreadsheet or document\n- Review any scheduling system you use\n\nIf you can tell me where this schedule is stored (e.g., a specific file path, Google Sheet, Outlook calendar), I may be able to help you locate that information."
